  "metadata": {
    "brief": {
      "text": "The Admin page of It's a Date (/admin, logged in as Panos): site header with Panos's menu, tabs Pending (oldest first, Approve / Edit / Reject), All ideas (status filter and search), Tags (add, rename, delete) and Users (role chip, Make admin / Remove admin); Edit side panel (full-screen sheet on phone) with Not set for migrated ideas; stacked cards at 360px; States board behind a closed toggle with 9 states.",
      "answers": {
        "platform": "Web app",
        "density": "Medium"
      },
      "assumptions": [
        "Light theme only (spec section 4)",
        "Logged in as Panos (admin); header from _shared/nav.html with the Admin menu item current",
        "Pending queue oldest first: idea 13 plus two more pending ideas added to content.md",
        "States board is design-only, in a closed details toggle under the page",
        "Tags, place types, budget and duration labels from packages/shared constants",
        "Photos reuse verified photos from content.md, or the no-photo placeholder"
      ]
    },
